Live-range holes in unchanged kernel reductions — 2026-10-16

Interference and call survival use sorted inclusive per-block live segments.
The hull only orders and expires intervals. Fixed bindings, early clobbers
and call constraints remain. Eviction must free every conflicting occupant
of a chosen register. Identity-copy removal unites complete same-class,
same-location name components, including both incoming definitions at a join.
No independent checker or Lean proof profile is weakened or extended.

Instructions count only the named symbol, not its callees. The loop has 100
calls; every other row has 100,000. Inputs and GCC-built drivers are unchanged.
